===== 4. Result =====
optee_os default TA key          : RSA-4096
root signature on the test subkey: RSA-2048
[RESULT] MISMATCH CONFIRMED - the test subkeys of optee_test 4.6.0 were signed with an
         RSA-2048 root key, but this optee_os embeds an RSA-4096 default key.
         OP-TEE correctly rejects the chain (TEE_ERROR_SECURITY). This is a test-suite /
         key version mismatch, not a defect of the RISC-V OP-TEE port.

